     "caps": false,
     "sz": 18,
     "paras": 3,
     "text": "Eng baland cho'qqi — Everest (8 849 m)\nO'zbekistonda eng baland nuqta — Hazrati Sulton (4 643 m)\nHar 100 m balandlikda havo ~0,6 °C soviydi",
